From 53985bbf80064e1f0d0be93373ada6f8ed30cdec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Disturbed Ocean <241662633+DisturbedOcean@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 14:11:11 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(pi-compat): run Pi 1.5 extension-owned provider streams

Lets Pi packages that bring their own provider (custom endpoint, headers
and auth) register and stream it through the installed Pi release.

- googleGenerativeAIApi/openAICompletionsApi resolve to the installed Pi
  streams; anthropicMessagesApi does too for extension-owned requests.
- registerProvider accepts Pi 1.5 config: name becomes the label, compat/
  headers/output/type pass through to the extension's stream, image models
  and refreshModels/classifiers/images are dropped, empty catalogs unregister.
- Registrations from activation-time discovery that land after the load
  scope no longer kill the transport.
- async tool hints and non-required constrained sampling fall back to the
  plain schema, as native routes do.
- Signatures the provider event protocol cannot carry are kept in the
  adapter and replayed; thinking is hidden on routes whose host validation
  requires opaque reasoning state.
